  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods Programme Development - Diocese of Monze</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;	To learn the benefits of sustainable livelihoods from partners implementing the Livelihoods Programme Zimbabwe (LPZ) activities
&quot;	To identify challenges and lessons learned from partner organisations implementing the LPZ in order to take account of these aspects in planning a similar approach for Monze Diocese
&quot;	To develop a quality integrated strategic plan and proposal
&quot;	To network and share information and lessons with the view of developing a Regional Development Comparative Analysis</narrative>
  </description>
